WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.470
 Matte next to shine creates
something really special

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:03.970
to look at.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.740
Look at me?

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:06.240
Gorgeous.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:09.840
I'm Sir John.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.990
And in the next 30 days, you'll
learn the exact techniques

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.730
I use on my celebrity clients.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.380
I'm going to demo
three looks that

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:22.350
are going to rock your
world-- the Everyday Look,

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:23.730
the No-Makeup Makeup Look,

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.695
and the Icon.

00:00:25.695 --> 00:00:26.820
We're going to dive into my

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.420
makeup kit, step-by-step.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.167
I'll show you what to buy, what
to keep, what to throw away.

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:33.000
You don't need to know
anything about makeup

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.350
to take this class.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.060
Skin is skin.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:36.030
And that is genderless.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:36.780
It's ageless.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.670
It's timeless.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:39.840
Let's do it.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.330
No-Makeup makeup is all
about just adding definition,

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.160
using minimal products.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.690
I always work from
my hand because I

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.060
don't want to pour all of
my money into the sponge.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.130
You want it to go
directly onto the skin.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:52.410
Around the eyes, always
use your ring finger.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:53.920
It's the weakest
finger you have.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:57.120
Think about tapping
and not just rubbing.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.520
Super excited to show
you my Everyday look.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.810
Layering is key.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.510
I like to use cream, and
I set it with a powder.

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:06.810
That creates a face that will
last you all day, all night.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.720
Always keep a couple brushes
that have no product on them

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.130
as little magic erasers.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.380
I've had some of these
brushes since I was 19.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:16.842
If these brushes could talk,
they would need an NDA.

00:01:16.842 --> 00:01:18.300
I want to show you
how much fun you

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:21.690
can have with light reflection,
with depositing color

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:22.860
for smoky eyes.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.300
Start small and then
blow out the color.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:28.300
Apply a little cream blush
into the crease of the lid.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.700
This is for someone
who loves glam.

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:34.280
My first memories with makeup
was going to be my mom.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.040
I just remember her always
applying mascara or a lip,

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.220
and it changed her mood.

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:40.220
There was a little bit
more of a pep in her step

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:44.660
after she had a minute to
give herself self care.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.150
I don't want you to look
at anything here as a mask.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:48.980
But how can I uncover?

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:52.010
How can I reveal more of who
I am or who I want to be?

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:53.870
The most impactful
thing you can do

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:56.330
is to really love and be
connected to whoever you're

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:58.130
looking at in the mirror.

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:00.710
And then a lipstick helps.

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:03.410
I'm Sir John and
this is MasterClass.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.460
[MUSIC PLAYING]

